IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `P8-gate`
IMPORT `P8-art73`
IMPORT `P8-art75`

-- Tests of Article 75. The group General applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113). The system below is high-risk under Annex III and placed on
-- 2 December 2027 (not saved by Art 111(2)); the saved case is a system placed on 1 January 2026 and asked about on 1 January 2027.
-- Each as-enacted text is tested directly, because through the dispatcher it is dead: the group General applies from 2 August 2026, and the amended text from 27 July 2026.

`Art 75 test on` MEANS Date 2 8 2026
`Art 75 test before` MEANS Date 1 8 2026
`Art 75 test route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
`Art 75 test placed` MEANS Date 2 12 2027
`Art 75 test placed earlier` MEANS Date 1 1 2026

§ `Art 75(1): the AI Office's competence, both versions`

