§ `Seam S14: Article 2(2) cuts off a provision about a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products`

-- Added 2026-11-17 for seam S14 (fork F-S14-reach, assumed, not ruled). Each case is an existing case of this file with only the route and the two Section B facts changed.
-- Route Article 6(1) and Annex I with products covered by Section B: Article 2(2) says "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply", so the function answers JUST FALSE (a number: NOTHING; a rule: FULFILLED).
-- The integration fact (the second Section B input) matters to Articles 57 to 59 only, so it changes nothing here. Another route, or products not covered by Section B, leaves the function on its own provision.
-- Art 75(1a) first sentence the provider must report the serious incident to the AI Office
#ASSERT `Art 75(1a) first sentence the provider must report the serious incident to the AI Office` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 75(1a) first sentence the provider must report the serious incident to the AI Office` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 75(1a) first sentence the provider must report the serious incident to the AI Office` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 75(1a) first sentence the provider must report the serious incident to the AI Office` `Art 75 test on` `Art 75 test route` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- EXPECT FULFILLED  (S14: cut off)
#TRACE `Art 75(1a) the provider's duty to report the serious incident to the AI Office` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 3 8 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE AT (Day (Date 3 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party provider` DOES `Art 75(1a) report the serious incident to the AI Office` AT (Day (Date 19 8 2026))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED  (S14: cut off whether or not the requirements are integrated)
#TRACE `Art 75(1a) the provider's duty to report the serious incident to the AI Office` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 3 8 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE AT (Day (Date 3 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party provider` DOES `Art 75(1a) report the serious incident to the AI Office` AT (Day (Date 19 8 2026))
-- Art 75(1e) first sentence the AI Office is responsible for the conformity assessments and tests of the AI syst
#ASSERT `Art 75(1e) first sentence the AI Office is responsible for the conformity assessments and tests of the AI system` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 75(1e) first sentence the AI Office is responsible for the conformity assessments and tests of the AI system` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 75(1e) first sentence the AI Office is responsible for the conformity assessments and tests of the AI system` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 75(1e) first sentence the AI Office is responsible for the conformity assessments and tests of the AI system` `Art 75 test on` `Art 75 test route` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
