#ASSERT `Art 75(1e) second subparagraph the provider must pay the costs of the services entrusted to the notified body directly to the notified body` `Art 75 test on` `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` `Art 75 test placed` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
